    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Rooney Auctioneers are delighted to present 3 exceptional detached home's in the stunning new development at Dun Na Coille, Sixmilebridge, Co. Clare, right in the heart of the Village. Already proving hugely popular with buyers across Clare and Limerick, now available offering a rare opportunity to secure a home in this exclusive cul-de-sac of large, detached properties. Each home has been finished to impeccable standards, with spacious gardens, generous parking, beautiful landscaping, and elegant architectural design.\r\nBuilt to the highest specification, showcasing meticulous attention to detail and contemporary design. The accommodation features bright, open-plan living areas balanced with private spaces, along with generously proportioned bedrooms for comfort and style. With an impressive A2 BER rating, this home delivers superb energy efficiency alongside modern luxury.\r\nDun Na Coille is a prestigious development of luxury detached homes, nestled on an elevated site in the picturesque village of Sixmilebridge. \r\nSurrounded by landscaped green areas, Dun Na Coille provides a peaceful and family-friendly setting while enjoying the charm of  Sixmilebridge Village. Perfectly situated  while being only 15km from Limerick City. The village is also convenient to Shannon airport 15km and Sixmilebridge train station. This exceptional location offers the perfect blend of tranquil countryside living with superb connectivity. Large site with landscaping, patio areas and a host of additional extras. \r\nThis is a unique opportunity to acquire a magnificent home where quality, style, and location come together seamlessly. Early viewing is highly recommended.\r\n\r\nLocated in the exclusive and highly sought-after Dun Na Coille development in Sixmilebridge, County Clare, this outstanding site offers the perfect balance of peaceful living and superb convenience.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\nFully serviced site\r\n\r\nThis is a spacious, modern ‘A’ rated family home\r\n\r\nFully connected to Mains\r\nSituated within an exclusive, well-maintained development\r\nLarge green area within the estate\r\nPeaceful, quiet, and child-friendly environment\r\n\r\nWalking distance to local amenities and the local school\r\n\r\nEasy access to the M18 motorway, providing quick connections to Limerick, Shannon, Ennis and Galway\r\n\r\nConvenient access to Shannon International Airport"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "FEATURES\r\nSome of the many fantastic features.\r\n-              Block built house pre cast flooring on first floor\r\n-              A2 energy rating\r\n-              Underfloor heating\r\n-              High quality painted internal doors\r\n-              Contemporary Shaker architrave and skirting\r\n-              Internal smooth finish painting throughout\r\n-              Superior quality internal joinery\r\n-              Wired for high speed broadband (Cat 6)\r\n-              Thermostatic zoned heating controls\r\n-              Pressurised hot and cold water\r\n-              10 year Structural / Latent Defects insurance\r\n\r\n\r\nMEDIA AND COMMUNICATIONS:\r\n•              Wired for high-speed broadband (Cat 6).\r\n•              TV connection point in living room.\r\n•              Main infrastructure installed to accommodate high-speed fibre broadband.\r\n\r\nELECTRICAL:\r\n•              Generous lighting and power points.\r\n\r\nHEATING:\r\n•              High efficiency Air-To-Water heating system with thermostatic zoned heating controls. \r\n•              Underfloor heating to ground floor and first floor. \r\n•              Pressurized hot and cold water. \r\n\r\nENERGY EFFICIENCY:\r\n•              A2 BER energy rating. \r\n•              Highly insulated air-tight design.\r\n•              Excellent levels of roof, wall, and floor insulation. \r\n•              A-Rated Air-to-Water heat pump \r\n•              Energy saving LED light fittings.\r\n\r\nEXTERNAL FEATURES:\r\n•              Large, glazed patio doors to private rear garden.\r\n•              Generous access at side of house. \r\n•              Seeded gardens, and post and blocked and capped dividing walls. \r\n\r\nWARRANTY\r\n•              10 year Structural / Latent Defects Insurance provided by HomeBond."
      },
